Role Overview:

Landor, Global Design Studio, is looking for a talented Senior Designer to join our multi-skilled and multicultural APAC studio team. The role focuses on creating strategically driven design solutions for corporate brands, with a strong emphasis on typography, corporate identity, brand systems, and packaging visuals. &nbsp;

We are looking for a designer with a deep passion for type and typography, someone who understands how typeface selection, typography, hierarchy, spacing, composition, and lettering can shape a distinctive brand identity. The ideal candidate will have a portfolio that demonstrates strong typographic thinking and the ability to use typography as a central creative tool across branding, packaging, and visual identity systems. &nbsp;

The candidate will explore and conceptualise design ideas, develop typography-led visual languages, and lead projects from concept through execution. As the role supports our APAC and Europe regions, the candidate may begin their day earlier to collaborate effectively across time zones while working closely with the broader global studio. &nbsp;

&nbsp; What&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;do: &nbsp;

• Collaborate closely with Design Directors and the wider creative team to develop strategically led, typography-focused design solutions. &nbsp;

• Explore creative directions where type, fonts, lettering, and composition play&nbsp;a central role&nbsp;in defining the brand's visual language. &nbsp;

• Translate brand strategy and creative briefs into distinctive typographic concepts and visual identities. &nbsp;

• Develop and refine typographic systems, including typeface&nbsp;selection, hierarchy, layouts, grids, spacing, and applications across brand touchpoints. &nbsp;

• Work extensively across corporate identity and packaging, creating strong typography-led visual systems that are distinctive, scalable, and commercially relevant. &nbsp;

• Push beyond conventional type treatments to explore new and expressive ways of using typography within branding. &nbsp;

• Demonstrate a strong understanding of how typography works alongside imagery, illustration, colour, and graphic elements to create a cohesive brand world. &nbsp;

• Contribute to design development from&nbsp;initial&nbsp;concept through to final artwork,&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;a high level&nbsp;of craft and attention to detail. &nbsp;

• Work collaboratively with internal teams and, where relevant, clients, communicating design rationale and typographic thinking with clarity. &nbsp;

